{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/5d89f697e90f767ecf72476483b5b977.poster.avif?t=1768305933\" width=770 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/5d89f697e90f767ecf72476483b5b977.webm?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/5d89f697e90f767ecf72476483b5b977.mp4?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/b33aa551bdaaba48f4df2749f563e8a0.webp?t=1768305933\" width=771 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your own fish, jellyfish, submarines (or anything you imagine) and drop them into your\u00a0very own aquarium. Feed your creations, celebrate their\u00a0birthdays, and watch them grow. As they age, their shimmering metallic shine will reveal their\u00a0journey. <br><br>Can you raise one all the way to a golden fish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/39542f37e17764417623e41bb71dbc0a.poster.avif?t=1768305933\" width=350 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/39542f37e17764417623e41bb71dbc0a.webm?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/39542f37e17764417623e41bb71dbc0a.mp4?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/ffe86e5b3fbc5cbc2da3ee70b09355d2.poster.avif?t=1768305933\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/ffe86e5b3fbc5cbc2da3ee70b09355d2.webm?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/ffe86e5b3fbc5cbc2da3ee70b09355d2.mp4?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw your very own inhabitants</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish, plants, rocks, castles, jellyfish, submarines, spaceships... whatever you dream up.\u00a0<strong>Use template shapes</strong> if you need a little inspiration or go freestyle. The canvas is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/f7225b9c9ad7c3b9729e81d83636bcec.poster.avif?t=1768305933\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/f7225b9c9ad7c3b9729e81d83636bcec.webm?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/f7225b9c9ad7c3b9729e81d83636bcec.mp4?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock milestones</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in the game, you will unlock additional ways to customize your aquarium decor. Sand color, driftwood, custom lighting and a hand drawn castle home for your fish.\u00a0Your aquarium becomes a tiny living world, filled with creatures made by you and your loved ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/b1d64cd7d03746644735ce3370e3921c.poster.avif?t=1768305933\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/b1d64cd7d03746644735ce3370e3921c.webm?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/b1d64cd7d03746644735ce3370e3921c.mp4?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Visit anytime </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>for a gentle, mindful break </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2665</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/6103f7baf129af1ce479cee20c4f74e4.poster.avif?t=1768305933\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045480/extras/6103f7baf129af1ce479cee20c4f74e4.webm?t=1768305933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat